      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm a city council member looking at our new affordable housing mandate. We have a limited number of units coming online and need to decide on an allocation strategy. Can you analyze the different ways we could distribute these—maybe looking at things like lotteries, income-based tiers, or transit proximity—and tell me which one is actually the most equitable approach for the city?",
